{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">屯門富發里一個地盤有水管滲漏，部分屋苑晚上11時後停水，進行維修。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">滲漏的水管不停有食水湧出。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.WATER-0000.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026wUeu9uzsJV1785276588.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.WATER-0000.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">水務署表示，昨日下午接獲相關報告，該水管用作供應食水給怡峰園、顯發邨、恆順園、冠峰園及屯門官立中學。水務署貼出公報，要暫停供水。已在附近放置15個水箱，提供臨時食水。並爭取今日中午12時前，恢復食水供應。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.WATER-0000_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026da3b7xE9qE1785276911.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.WATER-0000_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T22:38:18.695568+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}